/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/resources/base/profile/main_pages.json:2)\n- 首页标题“云音汇”由 `IndexHead` 渲染；右侧更多按钮绑定 `MoreMenu()`。[IndexHead.ets:11](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/head/IndexHead.ets:11)\n- 更多菜单的“设置”项调用 `router.pushUrl({ url: 'pages/Settings' })`；“下载管理”进入 `pages/Downloads`。[IndexHead.ets:31](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/head/IndexHead.ets:31)\n- 设置页返回按钮复用 `BackButton`，其实现是 `router.back()`。[BackButton.ets:8](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/buttons/BackButton.ets:8)\n- 其他现有跳转：\n- 首页搜索进入 `pages/SongsListPage`，通过参数传递 `searchKeyword`。[SearchComponent.ets:24](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/main/SearchComponent.ets:24)\n- 未登录用户从个人面板进入 `pages/LoginPage`。[MeSheet.ets:14](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/sheets/MeSheet.ets:14)\n- 登录页用 `router.replaceUrl` 进入 `pages/login/WebLogin`。[LoginPage.ets:18](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/pages/LoginPage.ets:18)\n- 歌单卡片进入 `pages/PlayListPage`，传递歌单对象和歌曲数量。[PlayListCard.ets:30](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/main/PlayListCard.ets:30)\n\n## 3. 场景一基线现状\n\n- 设置页由 `Settings` 组件渲染，包含 `Version`、`Privacy`、`Feedback` 三个列表项和底部 `Bottom` 信息。[Settings.ets:12](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/pages/Settings.ets:12)、[Settings.ets:18](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/pages/Settings.ets:18)\n- “当前版本”行已经存在，但页面显示值来自 `Constants.VERSION + Constants.VER_DESC`。[Settings.ets:40](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/pages/Settings.ets:40)\n- 当前常量仍为 `0.9.2 - 测试版`。[Constants.ets:1](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets