 页面内使用 `Web({ src: '', controller: this.controller })`，并在 controller attached 后调用 `loadUrl`。[WebLogin.ets:20](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/pages/login/WebLogin.ets:20)\n- `CommonHead` 内部已经包含返回按钮、标题和状态栏避让逻辑。[CommonHead.ets:3](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/head/CommonHead.ets:3)\n- **明确缺失**：`PrivacyPage` 文件、路由注册、应用内 Web 页面和应用内返回链路。\n- **已有走查记录**：点击隐私政策后前台变为 `com.huawei.hmos.browser/MainAbility`，找不到 `Web` 节点；连续返回仍未回到设置页。[walk.log:587](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/logs/baseline-walk/walk.log:587)、[walk.log:590](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/logs/baseline-walk/walk.log:590)、[walk.log:597](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/logs/baseline-walk/walk.log:597)\n\n## 5. 场景三基线现状\n\n- 首页搜索组件的状态是组件内 `@State searchKeyword: string = ''`。[SearchComponent.ets:3](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/main/SearchComponent.ets:3)\n- 当前占位文案仍为 `请输入搜索词`。[SearchComponent.ets:12](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/main/SearchComponent.ets:12)\n- 当前搜索输入只设置了背景色，没有显式设置 placeholder 色或输入文字色。[SearchComponent.ets:12](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/main/SearchComponent.ets:12)\n- 搜索按钮点击时使用 `if (this.searchKeyword)` 判断：\n  - 非空字符串进入 `pages/SongsListPage`；\n  - 空字符串显示旧 Toast `请输入搜索词`。[SearchComponent.ets:24](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/components/main/SearchComponent.ets:24)\n- 因此代码层面空字符串不会进入结果页，但纯空格字符串在 ArkTS/JavaScript 真值判断中属于真值，当前会进入搜索结果页。这一点不是 Spec 明文，属于代码推导，需作为边界风险记录。\n- 搜索结果页在 `onPageShow` 中读取路由参数并调用 `getSongsList`，加载过程中显示 `LoadingProgress`。[SongsListPage.ets:11](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/entry/src/main/ets/pages/SongsListPage.ets:11)\n- `getSongsList` 请求 `${ROOT_URL}/search?keywords=...` 并映射为 `S