yPage`，页面显示自身标题栏和 Web 内容容器。即使网络内容暂未加载，仍须显示应用内页面的标题，并支持正常返回。\n    21→\n    22→### 操作步骤与预期结果\n    23→\n    24→1. 用户在设置页点击“前往查看本软件的隐私政策”。\n    25→2. 前台应用仍为云音汇，新页标题显示“隐私政策”，页面内存在 Web 组件。\n    26→3. 用户执行返回操作后回到“设置”，0.9.3 版本值仍可见。\n    27→\n    28→## 场景三：搜索框和空内容提交使用同一文案\n    29→\n    30→### 场景概述\n    31→\n    32→首页搜索框的占位文案由“请输入搜索词”统一为“请输入搜索内容”，并补充清晰的占位色和输入文字颜色。用户不输入任何内容直接点击搜索时，Toast 使用与占位文字相同的新提示，且不进入空搜索结果页。\n    33→\n    34→### 操作步骤与预期结果\n    35→\n    36→1. 用户重新返回或启动首页，搜索输入框显示“请输入搜索内容”。\n    37→2. 保持输入框为空并点击右侧搜索按钮。\n    38→3. 应用显示“请输入搜索内容” Toast，首页标识仍可见，不跳转到空关键词的搜索结果页。\n    39→\n</file>\n<metadata>The file has 39 lines in total.</metadata>","metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/requirement.md","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/spec/requirement.md","resolution":"absolute","endLine":39,"startLine":1,"totalLines":39}}},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01CFRwoLKChuVL7YTuVm6a4G","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/spec/metadata.json"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"<file>\n     1→{\n     2→  \"base_commit\": \"ebe2fbceaf5270ef0f5302edc4f77fa5962b0a3f\",\n     3→  \"baseline_bundle\": \"repo_bundles/cloudmusic-harmonyosnex-ebe2fbceaf-base.bundle\"\n     4→}\n     5→\n</file>\n<metadata>The file has 5 lines in total.</metadata>","metadata":{"relativePath":"spec/metadata.json","absolutePath":"/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114/spec/metadata.json","resolution":"absolute","endLine":5,"startLine":1,"totalLines":5}}},{"id":"toolu_bdrk_017ysQpkCRgrZ7YrDqtY285S","type":"TOOL","toolName":"read_file","params":{"file_path":"/Users/bress/.comate-engine/store/terminals/8oetzo.output"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (58.3KB). The file has 491 lines in total.\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n     1→status:   completed\n     2→cwd: /Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/cmu-spec114\n     3→command description: 用完整 DevEc