armony.tech/#r-scoring"},"toolState":"executed","result":{"output":{"$blob":"sha256:f365fd3b4fdbd3707da559fc3c9bed028431595ca41e51832aa0339507b3b82d","version":1,"encoding":"utf8","byteLength":9602,"compression":"none"},"metadata":{"site":{"content":"决赛名额和奖项数量何时确定？＋\n\n在线上评测与复核结束后，根据有效参赛规模、成绩分布、现场容量及奖金预算确定，与入围通知一并公布，最迟决赛前7日明确。入围队伍须在名单公布后48小时内由报名登记邮箱确认到场及到场队员，逾期由候补队伍按排名依次递补。\n\n 现场提供电脑或模型账号吗？＋\n\n不提供。请自备电脑、开发和测试设备、软件环境、Agent、模型账号及算力。官方评测设备仅供技术委员会使用，不作为队伍开发设备。\n\n### 具体赛题技术答疑\n\n8 项\n\n商城搜索题（cml-combo-search、cml-spec24）在 x86\\_64 模拟器上安装失败，修改 abiFilters 也无效，怎么办？＋\n\n工程依赖的支付 SDK 中有两份原生库只提供 ARM64 版本，修改 `abiFilters` 不能生成 x86\\_64 版本，因此原始包无法安装到 x86\\_64 模拟器。\n\n 本地调试：针对 cml-combo-search、cml-spec24，可在独立调试副本中隔离这两份原生库，用于搜索功能自测，并标注支付功能不可用。\n 正式提交：保留原有支付依赖及相关代码，恢复仅为 x86 调试...","title":"2026 AI辅助研发创新大赛（鸿蒙杯）","url":"http://swe-openharmony.tech/#r-scoring","source":null}}}}]},{"id":"6ad5d562e2713b7e00f80a51","discard":false,"metrics":{"duration":20847},"hasUnpairedToolUse":false,"children":[{"id":"3e83ad19-64fd-4f81-8aae-d907f0c050c5","type":"REASON","end":true,"content":"I recall that there's no fixed official privacy/user agreement text specified for this task — teams can use their own suitable text, and the spec just requires showing the proper links without comparing against exact wording or URLs. I'm also checking what the Q&A says about music service configuration settings.\n\nOn the baseline, the hardcoded root URL isn't something I need to worry about since there's no API settings page in this baseline version. I also note the spec requirement that app page titles must display even if web content hasn't loaded, since the eval environment may lack internet access.\n\nNow I'm checking the emulator's reported device version against the official spec, and I want to verify the build command and check if build-profile.json5 was modified recently — I should look at file timestamps to figure out whether a prior session altered the SDK version before building.\n\nIf that file was i